graph TB
    subgraph "Local Network"
        A[Local Server/Proxmox] -->|Hosts| B[Nextcloud Service]
        A -->|Creates| C[Service User]
        C -->|Generates| D[SSH Keys]
    end

    subgraph "Internet"
        E[DuckDNS Service] -->|Updates| F[DNS Records]
    end

    subgraph "Public Host"
        G[HAProxy] -->|Frontend| H[SSL Termination]
        I[SSH Service] -->|Accepts| J[Remote Tunnels]
        K[DuckDNS Agent] -->|Updates| E
    end

    D -->|Copied to| I
    B -->|Tunneled via SSH| J
    J -->|Forwards to| G
    F -->|Points to| G

    style A fill:#f9f,stroke:#333
    style G fill:#bbf,stroke:#333
    style E fill:#bfb,stroke:#333
